    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Supporting information for the paper \"The rush to the margins: Impacts of land use policies on corporate investments in agriculture in the Gran Chaco and Chiquitano\". The .do file includes the code to run a nested logit model on the database, as described in the paper. The questionnaire was used to gather company data. The four tables of land price models show the results of four fixed effects models for land prices, as discussed in the SI.",
